---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout title="页面走失了 - 落秋笔记" description="404 - 你访问的页面不存在">
  <section class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 py-32 text-center">
    <p class="text-7xl md:text-8xl font-serif font-bold text-accent mb-6">404</p>
    <div class="w-16 h-0.5 bg-accent mx-auto mb-8"></div>
    <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-semibold text-ink mb-4">
      这一页，走失在了纸页之间
    </h1>
    <p class="text-ink-light mb-10">
      你访问的内容可能已被移除，或地址输入有误。
    </p>
    <a
      href="/"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-white bg-accent px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full hover:bg-accent/80 transition-colors"
    >
      <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7" />
      </svg>
      <span>返回首页</span>
    </a>
  </section>
</Layout>
